B.ZT=new A.b1(B.bq,["Daniel Ochieng","Upper Hill, Nairobi","SORA helped us manage our rental properties efficiently. They are a reliable partner and their team ensures that our properties are always occupied. Top-notch property management in Kenya."],t.l)
